  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Belize has set ambitious environmental targets, including reaching net zero and creating jobs within the blue, green, and orange economies. The Belize Chamber Commerce Industry (BCCI), supported by the ILO, previously reviewed training curricula to address skills mismatches in various sectors. Now, the BCCI has requested support to update these documents to include the blue, green, and orange economies. This will help learning institutions and the government identify areas of weakness and improve training programs to ensure workers are qualified for new positions. Beneficiaries include workers, businesses, and educational institutions, with the work being done in collaboration with the BCCI.</narrative>
  </description>
